            Comprehensive Course Offerings
          </span>

          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-foreground font-heading tracking-tight mb-4" data-ps="src/pages/lancaster-cpr-first-aid-courses.astro:xevws8">
            Custom-Tailored First Aid, CPR, and AED Training in Lancaster PA
          </h2>

          <div class="space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-8" data-ps="src/pages/lancaster-cpr-first-aid-courses.astro:8s5pxn">
            <p data-ps="src/pages/lancaster-cpr-first-aid-courses.astro:ymzs2r">
              We offer tailored training programs for businesses, community groups, and organizations in Lancaster. Whether you’re an experienced healthcare professional or a first-timer, our courses are built to prepare you for emergencies, no matter the situation.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Courses Grid -->
          <div class="mb-8" data-ps="src/pages/lancaster-cpr-first-aid-courses.astro:8s5pxo">
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground uppercase tracking-wider font-heading mb-4" data-ps="src/pages/lancaster-cpr-first-aid-courses.astro:mxt7yo">
              The CPR &amp; First Aid Training Classes We Offer:
            </h3>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3" data-ps="src/pages/lancaster-cpr-first-aid-courses.astro:8s5pxp">
              <a
                href="/heartsaver-first-aid"
                class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-primary transition-all no-underline text-foreground group"
               data-ps="src/pages/lancaster-cpr-first-aid-courses.astro:rc4rvj">
                <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-primary/20 text-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-primary-foreground transition-colors" data-ps="src/pages/lancaster-cpr-first-aid-courses.astro:8s5pxq">
